        skos:broader     CHEMONTID:0000002;
        skos:definition  "Organic aromatic compounds containing a thiophene ring fused to a pyridazine ring. A thiophene is a five-member aromatic ring with one sulfur and four carbon atoms, while a pyridazine is a six-membered aromatic ring with two adjacent nitrogen atoms and four carbon atoms.";
